t1l .-r;.,-..1-.,,. .l'i: l.cs;:r ,.:ii :r!.rirlici'tic,ltl ani liai;itn rx'ifit i'ther fesear0h celltersworking on the Gandhara worldwide'(ii) Publication of research magazine of international depute.(iii)Holdingofresearchworkshops,seminars,symposiumetc'(2) Subject to the approval of the authority the Gandhara Researoh centre shall beregulated by the rules made under Section 11 of this Act'(3) Subject to the approval of the authority, for promotion of research onGandhara, the Research Centre shall issue research standards and instructions for Gandharaculture.
g. Gandhara edia center: There shall be a Gandhara Media centre forpromotion of activities of the authority in print media, electronic mediq social media andinternational media.provided that the Gandhara Media Centre shall be integral part of the authority andshall work under the direction of the Chairman of the authority'
10. Gand ara heritage and andicra export center: There shatl be GandharaHeritage and Handicraft Export Centre which shall be responsible to the following:(D Patronage of local handicrafls, especially, related to Gandhara Art andCulture.(il) Marketing of local handicrafts related to Gandhara art and culture ininternational market.
provided that the authority may include or exclude any locally manufactureditem in the list of Gandhara handicraft art and culture'
11. ules: The authority with the approval of the board shall make rules and theSecretary of the authority shall publish the same in the offrcial gazette.
provided that the chairman may make the rules for a period of six months'However, the rules shall be approved by the board within 180 days'
12. Establish ent of d: There shall be established a fund to be known as the..Gandhara Fund,,. The fund shall be regulated as may be prescribed in the rules'
